# GSE282618 local additions (ADR 0030).
#
# `local/` is where this item's derived artefacts live; the tracked one is
# local/deg/GSE282618_deg.json. The regenerable outputs stay out of git:
#   - `*.csv` is already ignored by the repository-wide rule (DEG table and
#     sample sheet), but
#   - `*.tsv` does not match `*.tsv.gz`, so the compressed expression matrix is
#     pinned here instead of widening the repository-wide rule.
local/expr/*.tsv.gz
